Key Learning
Statistical Process Control

Monitor processes using measurements to detect variation before quality problems occur.

Lean

Remove waste to increase customer value and reduce costs.

Six Sigma

Reduce defects using structured improvement techniques.

Bottlenecks

The slowest process limits total system throughput.

Queues

Queues develop before bottlenecks and increase waiting time.

Lead Time

Total time from customer order until delivery.

Business Benefits
Improved productivity
Reduced operational costs
Faster delivery
Better customer satisfaction
Continuous Improvement
